// # Unified Neural Radiance Fields & 3D Gaussian Splatting Facade
//
// Logline: Master facade re-exporting all 49 NeRF, 3DGS, spherical harmonics, spatial encoding, and neural rendering submodules.
//
// Setup: Pure module shim and unified API importing all companion submodules in nerf_3dgs.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import 49 modular coordinate encodings, voxel grids, 3D Gaussian primitives, tile rasterizers, and quality metrics.
//   2. Re-export public rendering pipelines, camera configurations, and volumetric evaluators.
//   3. Maintain full backwards compatibility and uniform type access for openOODA neural graphics applications.

